cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Platypus.jl in your research, please cite it as below and report the version and source revision used."
type: software
title: "Platypus.jl: Descriptive Atypicality in Julia"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for descriptive entity atypicality relative to a supplied
  reference collection, with pairwise neighborhood, density, depth and copula
  estimators and a separate full-feature graph estimator.
authors:
  - family-names: Santoni
    given-names: Simone
